---
description: Change tracking
alwaysApply: true
---
- At the end of every task output a CHANGE RECORD block with: Why we changed it; How it works; Why it is necessary; Impact (cost, risk, timeline); Files and Patch IDs; Tests run with results; Rollback.
- Commit message format: FZ-<task number> <short summary>, then a blank line, then CL-<n> and PATCH-<n> lines if they exist.
- If you edited an upstream file that is not in the Patch Registry, say so explicitly so a row can be added.
